window.products.push({"id":379024,"name":"Kokorona Cordless Blackout Roller Shades for Windows, Room Darkening Pull Down Roller Blinds, Thermal Insulated Privacy Saving Energy Window Shades fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d39gLF2mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Blackout Roller Shades: 100% blackout roller shades give you complete privacy. The thick and sturdy textured fabric blocks 100% sunlight and UV, giving you a quiet and private environment. Our beautiful, affordable window shades reduce glare and incoming heat, protecting your furniture from heat. Safety Cordless Design: The room darkening blinds feature a cordless design, providing the safest solution for your children and pets. The mechanism inside the top rail has a smooth and steady roll-up speed to adjust curtain up and down. Pull the plastic handle to control the roller blinds and make them stop freely. Easy to operate. And the roller shades can be stopped at any position. Premium Material & Easy to Clean: The roller shades are made of 100% polyester fabric which has good water and dust resistance, soft and flame retardant. Our window roller blinds offer excellent performance in thermal insulation. Balance the temperature in your room and save energy. No special care is required, just wipe it with a damp cloth or feather duster. Installation Instructions: For inside mount, the depth of window should be at least 2.5\". The blind width should be at least 0.25\" less than the window width. For outside mount, 4\" wider than window to make sure the roller blinds can cover the entire window. Product Dimension: 43\" W X 72\" H. Color: White. Attention: the fabric width is 0.5\" less than the overall blind width due to top rail frame. Easy install for 5 minutes. Suitable for living room, bedroom, office, kitchen. If you have questions about roller shades, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d39gLF2mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kokorona","source_asin":"B0BYC6JLQZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYC6JLQZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYC6JLQZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
