window.products.push({"id":379036,"name":"Farmhouse Tiered Tray Two Tiered Tray with Decoration Window Sign and Plaid Beads, Rustic Round Decorative Wooden Tray 2 Tiered Serving Tray with Hand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lQl0AV6vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Farmhouse Tiered Tray with Decor Set: The farmhouse tiered tray presented with a vintage look and it with extra window sign and plaid wood beads with tassel to create a rustic feeling which matches your farmhouse style. Ideal for kitchen decor, bathroom decor, table and seasonal decor or gift idea Multi-purpose Tray: The use of tiered trays is not limited to being a decor tray in your bathroom or kitchen. You can also use it as a perfume tray, vanity tray, makeup tray, jewelry tray, spice organizer rack, etc. You can even disassemble it into two separate plates and used for candle tray! Easy to Assemble: Tool-free assembly! All you have to do is follow the steps in the instructions using the included metal connecting rod to assemble them and tighten the screws! The whole process may take less than 3 minutes! Portable Handle Design: The metal ring at the top of the tiered tray can be used as a handle which means you can easily transfer it or transfer the items displayed in the tray through it. It's a very useful feature when you are hosting a party or taking the kids out for a picnic! About the size: The diameter of large tray is 13\" and the small one is 9.5\". 18\" height after assembly; The spacing between the two layers of the tray can be set to 6.5\", 7.5\" and 14\" by adjusting the wooden connecting rod, which will be able to meet most of your daily needs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lQl0AV6vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"USESMTLE","source_asin":"B09X33FSGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X33FSGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X33FSGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":379037,"name":"Full Moon on the Lake by Philippe Sainte-Laudy, 18x18-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.56,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HrShy801L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a tree with pink flower by a lake with the moon in the sky. Photographer by passion for years, Philippe took an immediate liking to photographing landscape and nature. Always in search of the best light and the most original angle, he maintains a constant search for the most beautiful places surrounding him. Philippe prides himself in understanding the complex interactions between light, weather, landscape, the tides, plants and animals. He finds it is important to have a deep respect for this planet and its inhabitants. Philippe hopes that his photography can bring people closer to nature and encourage them to preserve it for future generations. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HrShy801L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BLXE8PI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BLXE8PI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BLXE8PI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
