window.products.push({"id":379047,"name":"Culina 16\"x 18\" Pizza Peel, Forged Aluminum, Wooden Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31pFXJjVjrL._AC_.jpg","description":"Still awkwardly removing pizza pies out of the burning hot oven with a long knife or a spatula? Can't find a tool large enough to slide the cheesy crust onto? Culina 16\" x 30\" Pizza Peel is the must-have kitchen essential you need to save yourself from burns, awkward juggling or worst, a flat fall while moving pies from oven to dinner table. Try our strong-built, performance-driven peel for a reliable and consistent use over the years. Safely and conveniently transfer food in and out of oven What distinguishes a great pizza from the average lot is a crust baked just right. To that end, pre-heating the oven at 400F is a must and requires precautions when transferring the pizza into the oven or reaching for the pie. Culina Peel boasts a 16\" x 18\" shovel head to conveniently slide breaded goods in and out of grills, stone or wood-fired oven. Although primarily geared towards bakers and pizzeria professionals to reach the back of extremely heated ovens or increase yield by speeding up the meticulous process, Culina quality peel is perfectly adapted to home use . Use the peel flat area to prepare the dough from scratch, simply add a healthy coat of flour to avoid sticking. Metal sheet shovel and wooden handle for great efficiency While wooden peel paddles are known for their rustic appeal, they also lack in performance and longevity. By contrast, Culina Peel 16\" wide front edge makes it easy for the pizza to slide right on and off without shifting around cheese and toppings. The large paddle area is a thick gauge of forged aluminum, a tough construction that won't easily bend, warp, break or let you down. The 16\" handle features a mix of wood to allow hands to stay cool longer. As a whole, our peel has a heavy-duty feel yet brings the lighthearted satisfaction of a job well done. An excellent gift idea for the upcoming Holidays, a birthday, a housewarming, Father's day or any occasion you see fit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31pFXJjVjrL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Culina","source_asin":"B00QXKN2OC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QXKN2OC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QXKN2OC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
