window.products.push({"id":379099,"name":"Koopower 9 Modes Speed Adjustable Fairy Lights, 36ft 100 LED Battery Operated String Lights, Dimmable and Waterproof Twinkle Lights for Gardens, Homes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811DlqOyGYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KooPower 9 Mode Outdoor String Light - To Brighten Your Home and Garden KooPower is a professional company specialising in KooPower branded LED Lights and consumer electronics. KooPower Waterproof Battery Operated LED Lights not only can be used in anywhere (Indoor and Outdoor) you need so liberate your sockets. They light your home and Garden at night and look fantastic. Perfect for Christmas, weddings, party, festival, garden, kitchen and etc. Features 9 Light Effect: 1.Combination2.Steady on3.Meteor shower4.Chase flash5.Sequential run6.Back running flash7.Stack8.All flash9.Disco Dimmable Press DIM- or press DIM+ of remote control or press the button \"Change ☼\" of battery box to adjust the brightness of the lights Adjust Speed of Twinkle Press SPEED- or press SPEED+ of remote control to adjust the speed of the twinkle lights Timer Program Once selected, the lights will turn on in the pre-programmed timing sequence of 6 hours on, 18 hours off over each 24 hours period. Waterproof Dustproofing and waterproofing to IP65 level makes these lights suitable for use in conditions where dust, rain, spraying water, snow or frost are likely. Perfect for use at Christmas, Easter, other celebration events . Tips: 1. The battery box with 2 buttons, Mode/p and Change ☼. You can press the Mode/P, chang the mode.Press and hold the (Mode/P)for 3 Seconds to power off. Press the button \"Change ☼\" of battery box to adjust the brightness of the lights.2. How long the lights last depends on batteries(3 x AA batteries, not included). So we suggest you select high quality batteries3. The timer function will work only when you switch to ‘TIMER' Package content: 2 x KooPower 9 Mode 100 LED Outdoor Battery Fairy Lights Muticolor1 x Remote Control(CR2025 battery, included)1 x User manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811DlqOyGYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"koopower","source_asin":"B0817K3326","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0817K3326","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0817K3326","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
