window.products.push({"id":379196,"name":"OYRGCIK Travel Pillow, 100% Pure Memory Foam Neck Pillow, Soft & Breathable Cotton Cover, Machine Washable Airplane Travel Kit U Shaped Pillow with 3D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81auAlfyMjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✈【Ergonomic Sleep Design】This ergonomically designed memory foam pillow provides support without the bulk. With perfect curves shape design, this travel pillow can better fix your neck, prevents head from falling forward, relieves neck pain during travel. The adjustable rope lock allows you to customize the angle of the pillow, give you neck support and comfort during the long flights or endless car rides. 🚄【Keep Cool and Clean】Our U Shaped Neck Pillow covered in a mix of soft 100% cotton and breathable and super soft magnetic therapy cloth, millions of tiny premium microbeads inside, provides the maximum comfort on your trip. There's a zipper for the machine-washable cover, so you could remove it and wash it to keep your neck pillow clean, ready to go the next time you need it. 🚗【100% Memory Foam】 Our travel pillow is made of high quality memory foam with 3 seconds rebound technology and therapeutic comfortable design. Memory foam gives you a good support and sleeping comfort as it responds to your body temperature and molds to the shape of your head and neck. 🚃【“Must Have” Airplane Travel Kit】This travel pillow is much effective to help relieve your fatigue when you have a long-time sitting. You could find the Travel Pillow, Earplugs, 3D Contoured Eye Mask all in the carry bag. The neck pillow could be easily folded and packed in the carry bag and be carried to anywhere you want. Eye-mask and earplugs would do a great help on airplane to reduce the influence from lights and noise. 🚢【Space Saving & Easy to Carry】The neck pillow size is 11 x 9.2 x 5.9 inches, the weight of the package is only 0.6 lbs. It comes with an improved travel bag that allows the neck pillow to compress down to ½ its size. With its snap strap, this pillow is easy to attach to the handle of your backpack or outside of your luggage without taking up extra space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81auAlfyMjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OYRGCIK","source_asin":"B07RZ44W7X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RZ44W7X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RZ44W7X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
