window.products.push({"id":379356,"name":"Tension Rods Shower 15.7 in to 28 Small Adjustable Curtain Rods Window Rods in Extendable Telescopic Width Spring Cupboard Bars for Kitchen Utensils, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ytip4ajSS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"SPECIFICATION: Material: high-carbon steel + rubber. Length: fixed length is 16\", adjustable length is 0\"-12\", total is 28\". Inside and outside tube diameter: 0.4in/0.5in. Maximum bearing weight: 3-7 pounds. HOW TO INSTALL: 1.To install, twist to unlock, with the narrow tube on the right side, place the rod into the desired location and extend both ends flush against each wall. 2.While holding the wide tube with your left hand, rotate the narrow tube firmly away from you with your right hand to lock in place. 3.Move your left hand to the narrow tube and with your right hand, rotate the right cap towards you for extra tension. 4.Keep rotating until rod is secure. TIPS: —In general, the greater friction of the wall, the shorter extension of the rod, the better effect of use. —Convenient installation.Don't need any screws. —Relatively speaking, wooden door's friction is greater than the ceramic tile, easier to fix the rod. You can use them with your creativity to make more space to store your light weight items. Even though we don't recommend for heavy duty use. If you are going to hang a lot of heavy stuff, we suggest you to buy a larger tension rods. For light weight items, this is perfect for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ytip4ajSS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gawon","source_asin":"B09NNDLHX7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NNDLHX7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NNDLHX7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
