window.products.push({"id":379398,"name":"Welcome Sign for Front Door Porch Decor with 14 PCS Interchangeable Holiday Icons 12 Inch Rustic Hanging Outdoor Premium Wooden Door Decorations Outsi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bVVvB27kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Design Upgrade】Our welcome sign for front door has been upgraded on the original basis, with a diameter of 12 inch and a thickness of 0.8 inch, large enough size and thickness look very sturdy and advanced. With 14 replaceable signs and 12 smart led lights. No matter every holiday, day or night, It can well meet your needs for front door decoration and welcome your guests. 【Premium Material】Don't waste money on buying other cheap. Different from the printed wood grain of others fronts porch décor, the front of our porch decor is made of plywood with clear natural wood grain. And our \"welcome to our home\" logo uses 3D wooden letters. Not using printed fonts like others. Use hot-melt glue to stick \"artificial eucalyptus, Plaid Bow, and letters\" on the wooden board so that it will not fall off easily. 【Seasonal Welcome Sign】Our outside home decor for front door come with 14 pcs Interchangeable Icons. Covers almost the important festivals of the year including: Spring, Summer, Autumn and Winter, Patrick's Day, Valentine's Day, Easter, 4th of July, Thanksgiving, Halloween, Christmas, etc. You won’t need waste money to think about changing your front door decoration anymore. 【Welcome in Night】12 pcs LED light bulbs around the wooden wreaths decorations can be seen from a distance, even in the evening, the most important family and guests can be welcomed. With clear \"ON\" and \"OFF\" switches on the back, you can freely switch the lights according to your needs.(2×AAA Battery is NOT included) 【Welcome Your Guests】 This outdoor rustic farmhouse welcome door decor is the best way to welcome your guests. It shows the enthusiasm of this owner. You can hang it wherever you want, including farmhouse, beach home, office, classroom, bar, restaurant. You can also use it as gifts for Thanksgiving, Christmas, housewarming, birthday parties, weddings, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bVVvB27kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baihui","source_asin":"B097FY9LYD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097FY9LYD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097FY9LYD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
