window.products.push({"id":379405,"name":"SouthShore FINE LIVING Early Spring Collection - Premium Quality, Soft, Wrinkle, Fade, & Stain Resistant, Easy Care, Oversized Duvet Cover Set, Full /","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9121IuQTTWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brushed Microfiber Imported HIGH QUALITY CRAFTSMANSHIP & OUR SIGNATURE FABRIC: You spend all day working hard.  You deserve quality sleep in Extremely gentle, comfortable, and smooth Duvet Cover Set.  These are made with our premium 110 GSM Double-Brushed fabric and & the softest duvets we have to offer. Our Duvets are breathable, Light weight, double-brushed for extra softness, shrinkage and fade resistant. WHAT IS INCLUDED? Your purchase contains 1 Over-sized Duvet Full / Queen Duvet Cover (98 inches x 98 inches) and 2 Shams (20 inches x 26 inches). Duvet has a high-quality zipper closure allowing you to easily replace your favorite insert (comforter) and 4 corner ties to keep it securely in place. This set does not come with an insert / comforter as it is a duvet cover set. We do sell matching comforters that fit the duvet cover perfectly in a separate listing. A BRAND NAME & LARGE ASSORTMENT: These duvets are high Quality and made under our flagship double brushed microfiber fabric. Available in dozens of colors and prints and 3 sizes, there is something available for everyone. Matching Sheet Sets, quilt sets and comforter sets are also available to complete the collection. 30-DAY RISK-FREE GUARANTEE: Our products are high quality & we back them up with a Risk & worry-free 30-day guarantee. If you are not satisfied for any reason, you can contact us to discuss return or refund options. Plus, our 1-YEAR warranty against any defects gives you one less thing to worry about. When you purchase a Southshore product, you are not just purchasing an exceptional quality home textile product, you are getting an absolute commitment on unmatched customer service as well. EASY CARE & FADE RESISTANT: Our duvets are made with Fade, Pilling & Wrinkle Resistant fabric. They will come out of the dryer looking fresh every time. These duvets are made with our Double-Brushed microfiber Fabric providing a substantially higher quality fabric and ultimate softness. Machine wash Cold, tumble dry. Do not use Bleach. Always close the zipper during washing to prevent snags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9121IuQTTWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc.","source_asin":"B08KD4QZVZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379405","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KD4QZVZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KD4QZVZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
