window.products.push({"id":379437,"name":"Café Affetto Automatic Espresso Machine + Milk Frother | Built-In & Adjustable Espresso Bean Grinder | One-Touch Brew in 90 Seconds | Steel Silver, 1.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":629.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+L8LPq2JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make delicious Espresso, Americano, or dispense hot water with the Café Affetto Automatic Espresso Machine + Milk Frother. With a single press of a button and in less than 90 seconds, this automatic espresso machine dispenses your desired brew. Customize drink preferences by volume and strength, with a smart espresso machine that syncs with the SmartHQ app. This compact espresso machine has a 7\" wide footprint and is adorned with signature copper accents, adding style and sophistication to any countertop. The built-in steam frother foam technology creates a variety of textures: airy for cappuccino, denser for latte macchiato and more. The wand rotates to the right at 90 degrees for control and convenience. Beans remain fresh in the built-in bean hopper that holds over 6 ounces. To ensure even extraction for a balanced tasting cup, beans are pre-infused with low pressure to gently bloom optimal flavor profiles and gradually increased to 20 bars of high rated pump pressure. You can control your grind size with 5 levels ranging from coarsest to finest for ideal taste and aroma extraction. With a removable water reservoir, adjustable dispensing spout, and 15.8 ounce frothing pitcher, cleaning and using your espresso machine is easier than ever.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+L8LPq2JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cafe","source_asin":"B09WL5RXSS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WL5RXSS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WL5RXSS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
