window.products.push({"id":379594,"name":"Cessna 172/172A ('56-'60) Standard size CheckMate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51diY2FSbKL._AC_.jpg","description":"The most complete, highly endorsed and recognized aviation checklists in the industry! You'll realize CheckMate checklists' incredible value the 1st time you use one. Many endorsements from Instructors of the Year, independent Flying Magazines and Aviation Safety Organizations have said it best: \"<em>Very comprehensive and practical. A worthy contribution to aviation safety</em>\" - Rod Machado, Writer, National Speaker, National Accident Prevention Counselor, Western Region Flight Instructor of the Year.<BR><BR>With over 300 aircraft models to choose from, CheckMate will most likely have the model(s) you fly regularly and in the future. CheckMate offers 2 sizes of each model single and twin engine aircraft. All data is included on both sizes. It's a pilot's personal preference that matters. CheckMate checklists cover Normal procedures and Vspeeds on the Front side and the most urgent Emergency procedures on the Back. Also included on the Back is a section displaying needed information for: weight & balance, fuel type & capacity, oil capacity, electrical size, and tire pressure. Trying to locate much of this data in the POH can be very time consuming and let's face it, lots of time isn't always what we have when flying an airplane.<BR><BR><strong>CheckMate Sizes:</strong><BR><LI>Standard size &ndash; 6.5\" x 9\"<LI>Compact size - 5\" x 7\"<LI>Some models also available in CheckBook Pocket Size 18 page flipbook.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51diY2FSbKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Checkmate Aviation","source_asin":"B004506L3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004506L3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004506L3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":379595,"name":"HLC.ME Lopez Velvet Premium Soft Light Filtering Back Tab Rod Pocket Window Treatment Curtain Drapery Panels for Bedroom & Living Room - Set of 2 Pane","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.64,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CwYDA9lUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester PERFECT FOR ALL ROOMS: These curtains offer such classy look they can go anywhere in the home. From your living room to your bedroom, these timeless, luxurious velvet curtain panels will really set of a perfect mood of relaxation. LIGHT FILTERING & PRIVACY: Our Lopez curtains are so soft to the touch and heavy. They will definitely allow some sunlight to enter the room while giving you some privacy when your guests are over. DUAL HANGING - ROD POCKET OR BACK TAB: If you want to get stylish when you have guests over, then these are perfect for you. The added tabs in the back of the window curtains allows you to hang your curtains in a designer look, than ordinary rod pocket curtains. Plus, they are very easy to install than the pole pocket. These affordable curtains will look as if you have spent top money on dressing your windows. PACKAGE DETAILS: Each package contains two (2) velvet back tab rod pocket curtain panels. These curtains can fit any rod up to 2\" inch. MACHINE WASHABLE: Machine Wash Cold, delicate cycle with mild detergent. Do not bleach. Tumble Dry Low. Cool iron if needed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CwYDA9lUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HLC.ME","source_asin":"B0C3HP7LWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379595","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3HP7LWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3HP7LWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
