window.products.push({"id":379658,"name":"Best Pepper Grinder or Salt Grinder Mill – Premium Stainless Steel One-Handed Automatic Battery Operated Spice Shaker - Adjustable– With LED Light at ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uwwygy7VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You'll be hard-pressed to find a spice mill that looks better than this one . It's tall, slim shape and the combination of brushed stainless steel and crystal clear acrylic make it a true classic. And like a fine sports car, this grinder features great performance as well as great looks. With just a light touch of the button on top of the mill, the quiet motor grinds out pepper or salt smoothly and evenly. No one who's tasted the difference between old, stale, pre-ground pepper from a shaker and the fresh-ground variety you get from a mill needs to be convinced of the value of a pepper mill on the table. And what about salt? Well, salt doesn't get stale like pepper, so it doesn't strictly \"need\" to be freshly ground. But a salt grinder with a clear acrylic chamber like this one allows you and your guests to enjoy the look of some of the truly beautiful mineral-rich colored salts that are available, such as pink Himalayan salt, red Hawaiian Alaea salt, or French gray sea salt. With the built-in LED light shining down on your food, you'll be able to see exactly how much spice you're dispensing, even at a romantic candle-lit dinner. So why not get this \"sports car\" of spice mills? This elegant mill will add style to your table and flavor to your meals, and will be admired by your guests. It also makes a great gift for anyone: families, couples, or singles; people who love to cook, or who just love to eat. Requires 4 AA batteries. Full 100% money-back guarantee. This ENHANCE SPICE product is sold with a full money-back guarantee. If you're dissatisfied with your purchase for any reason, contact us for a replacement or refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uwwygy7VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enhance Spice","source_asin":"B01MRGLCYZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379658","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRGLCYZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRGLCYZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
