window.products.push({"id":379724,"name":"Green Kitchen Ceramic Knives Set AND Universal Knife Block COMBO; Bonus FREE Ceramic Peeler; best knife holder; premium knives set; porcelain knives, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AbAIMh-ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Ceramic Knife Set contains a 6 inch Chef's Knife, 5 inch Santoku Knife, 5 Inch Utility Knife, 3 inch Paring Knife, a \"Green Grass\" Universal Knife Block and a ceramic vegetable peeler. Perfect Gift Set - Comes in a Beautiful Color Gift Box! The Green Kitchen Group LLC only manufactures products for which China has a unique history of high quality. Porcelain is one such area—Jingdezhen, China has been the world center for ceramics for thousands of years. These knives incorporate the unique features of Jingdezhen porcelain resulting in a pure white, almost translucent finish and unparalleled sharpness. The Green Kitchen Ceramic Knives: *Will never rust *Are ultra-lightweight, allowing for quick effortless chopping*Will stay sharp for up to 10x longer than steel knives - due to the hardened ceramic production process*Are perfect for fine slicing of fruits and vegetables because they won’t react with food acids, keeping your cut avocados bright and fresh Perfect Storage Block To get years of use out of your knives, store them in the included Universal Knife Block ($30 value!). Simply slide them into the knife block, taking care that they don’t touch each other. To wash the Block, first remove all of the knives. Then carefully turn the Block upside down and the green “grass” will slide out which you can wash on the top rack of your dishwasher. Care-Free The Green Kitchen ceramic knives require minimal care. After use, simply rinse with water and detergent, and wipe with a clean rag. After cutting non greasy food, you can just rinse the knives in warm water (please do NOT wash the knives in a dishwasher!). Now Includes a Ceramic Peeler Many of us like to peel apples before eating them. But they will turn brown if your peeler is metal. So we now include a FREE Ceramic Peeler.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AbAIMh-ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Green Kitchen Group LLC","source_asin":"B01H1PA6M8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H1PA6M8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H1PA6M8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
