window.products.push({"id":379769,"name":"Blueangle Beautiful Palomino Horse Round Placemats Set of 4, Non-Slip Decoration Table Mats, Easy to Clean Placemat for Dining Table, Kitchen Table","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P3DxMErRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Beautiful stylish, vntage placemats, fashion placemats and simple placemats add more fun to your table. Suitable to use in everyday dining, family gatherings, home parties, holiday, restaurants, business office or coffee shops etc. Blueangle Placemat: Measurement: diameter in 15.4inch / 39cm Package included: 4 x Round Placemats Material: high quality polyester, Durable, environmentally friendly.Features: The placemat is easy to clean, washable and heat resistant. Non-fading and non-slip. Single-sided use. Multi Occasion Use: Blueangle Table Placemats can easily dress up your dining table, coffee table, buffet table, tea table, etc. Not only perfect for everyday use, also for holidays,Christmas, parties,, birthday, picnics, farmhouse, lumberjack party decorations. Note: 1. Our plate mats are machine washable, Please use ordinary water below 70 ℃ and detergent to remove stains with a rag, then rinse with water, dry place in the shade. Do not wash with hard objects such as steel balls.2. The item is partially folded when it is packed. Please soak it into warm water and take it out, and put some heavy thing on it, then the crease will slowly disappear.3. All placemats are cut by hand and maybe one or two inches error. This will not affect daily use. If you have any comments about our Products and Service, please send an email to us,this will improve the quality of Customer Service and help us make better in products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P3DxMErRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blueangle","source_asin":"B085VD943P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085VD943P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085VD943P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
