window.products.push({"id":379918,"name":"Winlyn 30 Pcs White Jingle Bells with Star Cutouts Christmas Metal Sleigh Bells Rustic Craft Bells for Christmas Tree Wreath Garland Ornaments Holiday","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OsclE+UpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautifully Designed & Finely Crafted: The Christmas Sleigh Bells are made of metal and galvanized with a glossy or matte coating. With star cutouts on the top halves and keyhole-shaped cutouts on the bottom halves, these white craft bells encompass the essence of old-fashioned Americana and complement bold country style themes, too. Jingle Bells Ring with the Sound of Christmas: These Burgundy Christmas Jingle Bells with star cutouts are great embellishments for many rustic-inspired crafts projects, perfect for decorating Christmas tree, Christmas wreath, Christmas garland, swag, chandelier, gift wrapping, and more. They are ready to ring during the holiday season in your home! Beautifully Designed & Finely Crafted Fun Directions with Burgundy Craft Bells during Christmas Time: - String with red gingham ribbon and hang on your Christmas tree as holiday ornaments. - Add to your holiday door wreath for the perfect sound of the bells jingling when the door opens and closes. - String them up on twine or gingham ribbon to create a jingle bell garland. - Add a small sized jingle bell to your gift wrapping this year. - Use them for holiday table place card setting for a more whimsical touch. - Combine with other ornaments to create a wonderful bowl display. - Hang these jingle bells at different angles or lengths for fun and aesthetic designs!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OsclE+UpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winlyn","source_asin":"B08HMY6DVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HMY6DVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HMY6DVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":379919,"name":"Animal Print Real Leather Fabric: Genuine Leather Sheets for Earrings Leopard Print Soft Lambskin Leather(Iced Coffee, 8x10In/ 20x25cm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.17,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fm6Un27lL._AC_SL1020_.jpg","description":"What to Do With Leather Sheets? The Best Way to use the smallest scrap Leatheris to make simple Things like: Triangle Earrings Tassel Necklaces Bookmarks Coasters Zipper Extensions Leather Headbands Where to Get Leather? You can always check local Leather shops near to you but even then you do not know if there will be the one thing you are looking for  So we managed easy way for you to get what you need by sitting on the couch. We are putting as many variations of Leather Scraps on Amazon as we can- so you can choose what is best for you and get it as fast as possible by doing nothing. Leather goods are always in style and are the mark of a person who is steady and who values strong foundations. Leather has proven itself as a timeless fabric. Genuine leather will always add a certain degree of quality to any Designer work. Leather looks good and is an indicator of quality, appreciation of elegance, strength, and naturalness. It’s pretty amazing how one can communicate so many things through the fabrics. Have fun and let us know how it went :)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fm6Un27lL._AC_SL1020_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LeatherAA ITALIAN LEATHER COMPANY","source_asin":"B07Z6BBTSX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-379919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z6BBTSX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z6BBTSX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
